# Cynical Loner, Survival: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, you may search your library
# for a card, put it into your graveyard, then shuffle." Bot1 casts the Loner on turn 1 (Mox Jet and Mox Ruby), attacks with it on
# turn 3 (no vigilance, so it is tapped) and at the second main phase accepts and takes the Lightning Bolt out of its library into
# its graveyard: any card is a legal find. The library shrinks by one and Bot2 took 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Cynical Loner
Swamp x4
Swamp x12
Lightning Bolt

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cynical Loner.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Cynical Loner.Tapped = false
Bot1.Attack(Cynical Loner > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Cynical Loner.Tapped = true
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Search(Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
Bot2.Life = 17
